<title>UK: UK's Mowlem to float SGB subsidiary.</title>
<headline>UK's Mowlem to float SGB subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction group John Mowlem Plc said on Wednesday it plans to seek a full listing for its unit SGB Group Plc.</p>
</text>
